OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWet and windy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Fheavier rain through much of the day,
OL,7,Fpushing away during the afternoon to
OL,8,Fleave some evening bright spells.
OL,9,FStrong winds reaching gale at coasts,
OL,10,Fthen starting to ease during the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells give way to an
OL,14,Forganised band of heavy showers
OL,15,Fpushing in from the west overnight.
OL,16,FThese mostly clear by dawn with winds
OL,17,Ffalling light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
