OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry day with sunny spells
OL,6,Ffor most. Rain associated with Storm
OL,7,FAusten pushes into the south later.
OL,8,FMostly light winds, turning gusty with
OL,9,Fthe storm in the far southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStorm
OL,12,FAusten continues affecting the region
OL,13,Ffor most of Friday, clearing to
OL,14,Fscattered showers by evening. Further
OL,15,Frain and wind likely Saturday ahead of
OL,16,Fa drier interlude on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
